      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En Menfis vivía un toro sagrado: Apis.",
          "en": "In Memphis lived a sacred bull: Apis."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los sacerdotes buscaban un ternero negro con marcas blancas especiales, como un triángulo en la frente.",
          "en": "Priests searched for a black calf with special white marks, like a triangle on its forehead."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo cuidaban en un templo como a un rey. Era una señal viva de Ptah.",
          "en": "They cared for him in a temple like a king. He was a living sign of Ptah."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando moría, lo momificaban y lo enterraban en enormes sarcófagos de piedra en Saqqara.",
          "en": "When he died, he was mummified and buried in huge stone coffins at Saqqara."
        }
      ],
